        },
        {
          "name": "I",
          "type": "Index"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Scalar&",
      "docs": "\\returns a reference to the coefficient value at given index \\a i\nThis operation involes a log(rho*size) binary search. If the coefficient does not\nexist yet, then a sorted insertion into a sequential buffer is performed.\nThis insertion might be very costly if the number of nonzeros above \\a i is large."
